            <h5 class="h6 mb-1">Results</h5>
            <ul class="small mb-0 ps-3" style="line-height: 1.6;">
              <li>Seamless multi tenant architecture supporting numerous locations</li>
              <li>Real time booking to billing synchronization</li>
              <li>AI driven pricing optimization for increased revenue</li>
            </ul>
            <%= link_to "Read full case study →", case_study_path('golfpay360-saas'), class: "d-inline-block mt-3 fw-semibold small ajax" %>
